* hand-written from Razavi Fig. 7.32 -- topology only, no geometry
.title Razavi Fig. 7.32 — source follower with coupling capacitors
.global VDD
.subckt Fig7_32 vin vout
.iodir vin=input vout=output
.name vin V_in
.name vout V_out
C1 vin g
.name C1 C_1
RG VDD g
.name RG R_G
M1 VDD g s 0 nmos
.name M1 M_1
RS s 0
.name RS R_S
C2 s vout
.name C2 C_2
.ends
